  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">(26 fotos y un v&iacute;deo) El alcalde de Ribesalbes, C&eacute;sar Pallar&eacute;s Torres, y la reina de las fiestas, Leyre Vicent Corella, a la que acompa&ntilde;aba toda su corte de honor, han inaugurado a mediod&iacute;a de este s&aacute;bado en el Museo de la Baron&iacute;a la <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xaNeoSXV-_E\" target=\"_blank\">exposici&oacute;n de trabajos de las personas usuarias de la unidad de respiro local</a> (PINCHAR PARA VER EL V&Iacute;DEO).</font></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpounitatrespirribesalbes/img_7399.jpg\" alt=\"img_7399\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpounitatrespirribesalbes/img_7402.jpg\" alt=\"img_7402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpounitatrespirribesalbes/img_7403.jpg\" alt=\"img_7403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpounitatrespirribesalbes/img_7407.jpg\" alt=\"img_7407\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpounitatrespirribesalbes/img_7408.jpg\" alt=\"img_7408\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpounitatrespirribesalbes/img_7411.jpg\" alt=\"img_7411\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpounitatrespirribesalbes/img_7413.jpg\" alt=\"img_7413\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpounitatrespirr